{"neofx":1,"id":"pixelate","name":"Pixelate","category":"Stylize","params":[{"id":"size","name":"Block size","min":1,"max":80,"default":16}],"shader":"uniform shader image; uniform float2 resolution; uniform float time; uniform float size; half4 main(float2 p) { float s = max(size, 1.0); float2 q = floor(p / s) * s + float2(s * 0.5, s * 0.5); return image.eval(q); }"}
